{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39243","headline":"和陆谏议避地寄东阳进退未决见寄 · 韦庄","name":"和陆谏议避地寄东阳进退未决见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"未归天路紫云深，暂驻东阳岁月侵。\n入洛声华当世重，闵周章句满朝吟。\n开炉夜看黄芽鼎，卧瓮闲欹白玉簪。\n读易草玄人不会，忧君心是致君心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39243.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39243","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}